1
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:26,000
And now! At Last! Another film completely different from some of the
other films which aren't quite the same as this one is.

2
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Monty Python and the Holy Grail is a adventure, comedy,
fantasy film directed by Terry Jones.

3
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
King Arthur, accompanied by his squire, recruits his Knights of the Round Table, including Sir Bedevere the Wise,
Sir Lancelot the Brave, Sir Robin the Not-Quite-So-Brave-As-Sir-Lancelot and Sir Galahad the Pure.

4
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:26,000
On the way, Arthur battles the Black Knight who, despite having had
all his limbs chopped off, insists he can still fight.

5
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:46,000
They reach Camelot, but Arthur decides not  to enter, as "it is a silly place".

6
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
King Arthur / Voice of God / Middle Head /
Hiccoughing Guard, played by Graham Chapman.

7
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:26,000
Second Swallow-Savvy Guard / The Black Knight / Peasant 3 / Sir Launcelot the Brave
/ Taunting French Guard / Tim the Enchanter, played by John Cleese.

8
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:46,000
Dead Collector / Peasant 1 / Sir Robin the Not-Quite-So-Brave-as-Sir Launcelot / First Swamp
Castle Guard / Concorde / Roger the Shrubber / Brother Maynard, played by Eric Idle.

9
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:06,000
Patsy / Green Knight / Old Man from Scene 24 (Bridgekeeper) / Sir Bors
/ Animator / Gorilla Hand, played by Terry Gilliam.

10
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:26,000
Dennis's Mother / Sir Bedevere / Left Head / Prince Herbert /
